RESIDUALS (honest, out of 7.10 source close)
---

1. **Product host still concat** — `c_parse_secret_env` `oo_str_concat`×4
   until next seed/pure-multi. Named by Domain A residual 4.
2. **`char_at` 1-char temps** — every visit. Language floor, not
