4. **Lexer ident concat** — `token_scan_ident.oo` `id = id + c2`.
   Dominates long *body* idents (7.1 peer2 L≥16k). Unused-SECRET
   fixtures do not hit it (comment line).
5. **Full IFC / `#[Secret]` / `${}`** — not this residual.
6. **Stale banners** — `s71`/`s72` smokes and `s710_harness.oot` /
   `s710_integration.oot` still say 7.10 concat (written before / not
   this OWN). Integration snapshot at 18:54Z predates Domain A slice.
7. **Leading-digit SECRET names** — still accepted. Pre-existing
   semantic; not a concat issue.
8. **SPRINT row 7.10** — still listed HIGH open. This peer does not
   edit SPRINT.

